# `exit` ends the application, so there is no screen afterwards.
#
# **The absence is the assertion.** `P-617`: *the `then` is the whole of what the interface shows*,
# so a `then` with no `{screen}` row says no screen is shown. **`{running}` is this lane's choice**
# for saying the application is up, and the alternative - an empty `then` - cannot tell *exited*
# from *a test that forgot to say anything*.

{test name:exit-leaves-no-screen}

{given}
{running} -> 1
{screen name:menu}

{when}
{exit}

{then}
